faqs.a:
The following land uses are not allowed in any zoning district:
  1.	Criminal Detention facilities;
  2.	Disposal facilities;
  3.	Disposal of radioactive wastes;
  4.	Outdoor shooting ranges;
  5.	Intensive agriculture; and
  6.	Any marijuana use identified in Chapter 53, Article II of the Arvada Municipal Code.
